{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/chrome-overlay.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-17T23:28:10.005412Z","id":"dbc08752cab5e1c63563fe946eee288eb68793424df45bb647cfec9c8dc10522","body":{"detail":"Failure: 'the panel shows the live page's questions above its threads…' (an AbortError in the panel at the shot on line 1040) failed in a //web:e2e_chrome_overlay run beside the suite's other tests and passed in others, at 4ffb96fbf and at 641706256 alike. Cause recorded on web/e2e/extension-fixtures.ts:192:201: a spurious index.html change event seconds after the watcher's ready makes Vite reload the page.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":950},"end":{"line":950},"content_hash":"0aab4f4c1625fb094e74399457e1e4d4bfd40903c3b168b126f7b30172177b68"},"summary":"The test at line 950 can fail when Vite fully reloads its page on a late FSEvents report of the copied live site","tags":["tests","flaky","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/chrome-overlay.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-17T23:28:10.005449Z","id":"4f2b9c739610acc423df29dd1ba712597fe75ab2dcfb6080b3196b22ae79294d","body":{"detail":"Failure: 'the panel's Send names the owner's agents…' (seen at 4ffb96fbf) failed in a //web:e2e_chrome_overlay run beside the suite's other tests and passed in others, at 4ffb96fbf and at 641706256 alike. Cause recorded on web/e2e/extension-fixtures.ts:192:201: a spurious index.html change event seconds after the watcher's ready makes Vite reload the page.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1065},"end":{"line":1065},"content_hash":"d5b40f4777724297ce327f4ce1833d2af0a2e99959e3b597cfc393a80eb96efc"},"summary":"The test at line 1065 can fail when Vite fully reloads its page on a late FSEvents report of the copied live site","tags":["tests","flaky","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/chrome-overlay.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-17T23:28:10.005741Z","id":"3938415e292dbc1b36836608dfe19b64cd2606a91c0b310e9f5af01b54a9053f","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"065a23271e08eaba8f879e54ee8156fd3b1139c6a7d14dbcd7874e65743b1bd8","summary":"Reproduced at 4ffb96fbf too (failed in 3 of 7 runs there); the reload comes from a late FSEvents index.html change, recorded on web/e2e/extension-fixtures.ts:192:201","tags":["tests","flaky","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/chrome-overlay.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-17T23:28:10.005883Z","id":"69f7b83d096ea73c1e7a51f551640ce0dd052a3bf9ec3c3feea7b8e69483b353","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"83e0a6e0eb997452a9df8e4cdda40d04bb2c8a9ed37c8b715f8722a9a2fbb0a8","summary":"Reproduced at 4ffb96fbf (2 of 7 runs). A trace at 641706256 shows '[vite] hot updated: /main.js' then a full reload during the host's 18 s sleep, with no edit by the test: a late FSEvents report, recorded on web/e2e/extension-fixtures.ts:192:201. The click on #save then opened no composer","tags":["tests","flaky","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/drawer.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:15:40.530282Z","id":"718fd48158cdd96e6969bed299ea91eaa359d8745cee36577d6a3fceae979e3a","body":{"detail":"The test focuses the width separator with locator.focus() after mouse clicks, so :focus-visible (DrawerChrome.svelte:184) does not match. A pixel diff of target/drawer-shots/light-desktop-float.png against light-desktop-float-focus.png differs only in x 1288-1375, y 83-110 (the layout buttons); the window's right edge, x 1417-1423 at y 500, is identical in both. The same holds for the dark pair.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":248},"end":{"line":250},"content_hash":"a808d358b1bc85e1dd2703a07d5cf7ceb732fdb9e20e4214bf284e1c25c2b8e0"},"suggested_fix":"Reach the separator with the keyboard (focus the Hide threads button, then press Tab) before the screenshot, and assert the edge's ::after background is var(--focus).","summary":"The float-focus screenshot shows no focus indicator, so the separators' focus style is unverified","tags":["review","review:drawer-layout","session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/drawer.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:18:25.685824Z","id":"2c7a1e0ee5d0c6568605b5c89bf392ef795ff369b011ae173ce6f2d1f691845e","body":{"detail":"web/e2e/drawer.spec.ts:248 focuses the separator with locator.focus() after the layout buttons were clicked with the mouse (line 243), so the separator's style (web/shell/src/ui/DrawerChrome.svelte:184, :focus-visible::after) need not match. A PNG pixel diff of target/drawer-shots/<theme>-desktop-float.png against <theme>-desktop-float-focus.png gives: light, differing box x 1288-1375, y 83-110; dark, x 1188-1375, y 83-814 (the bar's buttons and the thread cards, nothing at the right edge). In both pairs the window's right edge, x 1417-1423 at y 500, is pixel-identical. The dark pair's differing box is wider than the finding states, but it too leaves the edge unchanged.","kind":"comment","references":"718fd48158cdd96e6969bed299ea91eaa359d8745cee36577d6a3fceae979e3a","summary":"confirmed: the float-focus screenshots show no focus line on the width separator","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/drawer.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:41:00.511080Z","id":"eeb148fc6b2e16c64b1b6499fba513c1f64c0400b7b793f0f1e6ffef50c1b6e0","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:fe3205f7b","summary":"The edges are reached with Tab from Hide threads before the focus screenshots, and expectFocusRing asserts :focus-visible and the edge's ::after background equal to --focus, for the floating width and height edges and the docked edge; a test of its own ('an edge reached from the keyboard shows its focus line in --focus') runs without CLAX_DRAWER_SHOTS. All pass in bazelisk test //web:e2e_rest (17 passed); target/drawer-shots/{light,dark}-desktop-{float-focus,float-focus-height,right-focus}.png show the green line along the edge.","supersedes":"718fd48158cdd96e6969bed299ea91eaa359d8745cee36577d6a3fceae979e3a","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/comment-markdown.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:28:58.613600Z","id":"6ad70c61b5a8be9477f58a1bb73071ac3666cb4512c2821b029264040df8b563","body":{"detail":"The scrollWidth check (line 126) sits after `if (!dir) return;` (line 114), so CI never runs it, and the comment it renders has a two-column table and short words. The CSS (Markdown.svelte:35,47,59-61) relies on `overflow-wrap: anywhere`, `min-width: 0` on `.md` inside the `.msg` grid, and scrolling `.tbl`/`pre`; nothing keeps that from regressing. markdown.test.ts has no case for table size or for hidden text (every source word appearing in plain()).","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":113},"end":{"line":127},"content_hash":"e381c6eb5da6110f2c85b8252902a802e3ae65b7d0dfc2d3d90dfb891172050c"},"suggested_fix":"Run the 390px scrollWidth check unconditionally on a comment with a 300-character word, a long bare URL, a 12-column table and a long code line, in the shell and in the extension panel.","summary":"Phone-width overflow is asserted only when CLAX_MD_SHOTS is set, and never for a long unbroken word, a long URL or a wide table","tags":["review","review:comment-markdown-115cb94","test-gap","session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/comment-markdown.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:30:45.671705Z","id":"0a8377b298359ce1d1529ebaab58efeb6a1cdd5c32748abc3205a6214b440aa1","body":{"detail":"web/e2e/comment-markdown.spec.ts:113-114 `const dir = process.env.CLAX_MD_SHOTS; if (!dir) return;` precedes the scrollWidth assertion at :126. The other scrollWidth checks under web/e2e (comments.spec.ts:164, echo.spec.ts:50/87, etc.) do not render Markdown comment bodies; comments.spec.ts:157-165 opens an empty thread panel. web/shell/src/view/markdown.test.ts has no table-size case (its only table cases are :90 and :221).","kind":"comment","references":"6ad70c61b5a8be9477f58a1bb73071ac3666cb4512c2821b029264040df8b563","summary":"confirmed: the phone-width check runs only with CLAX_MD_SHOTS and no test covers long words, URLs or wide tables","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/comment-markdown.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:50:00.877468Z","id":"6aec963d59c1e6fa84bd7f58ffcd3aa78455e944245372376a0d2a14bda4bfdb","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:ff0fa5dbf","summary":"Fixed in ff0fa5dbf: comment-markdown.spec.ts \"at phone width a long word, URL, table and code line stay inside the card, and every word shows\" and chrome-overlay.spec.ts \"a wide Markdown comment stays inside the side panel\" run without CLAX_MD_SHOTS: a 300-letter word, a long bare URL, a 12-column table and a 300-character code line, checking document, card and message scroll widths and that the table and code scroll inside. markdown.test.ts covers table size and hidden text. `bazelisk test //web:e2e_rest --test_arg=--grep=at.phone.width` and `//web:e2e_chrome_overlay --test_arg=--grep=wide.Markdown.comment` passed.","supersedes":"6ad70c61b5a8be9477f58a1bb73071ac3666cb4512c2821b029264040df8b563","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
